<title>POLAND: ELEKTROMONTAZ 96 NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>ELEKTROMONTAZ 96 NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.07 vs   0.06</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.36 vs   0.25</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.29 vs   0.24 profit</p>
<p> Sales		    3.93 vs   5.66</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.84 vs   0.08</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.57 vs   0.37</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.93 vs   1.03 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   43.02 vs  27.18</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Elektromontaz Export SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
